From: DE25-Nano port
Subject: [PATCH] Use the fixed Agilex fabric video pipeline

The shared DE25 shell owns the HDMI transmitter, output timing, and scaler.
Do not enter Main's Cyclone V scaler initialization, which waits on registers
that are intentionally absent and prevents user_io_init from returning.

diff --git a/user_io.cpp b/user_io.cpp
--- a/user_io.cpp
+++ b/user_io.cpp
@@ -1548,9 +1548,13 @@ void user_io_init(const char *path, const char *xml)
 		bootcore_init(xml ? xml : path);
 	}
 
-	video_init();
 #ifdef MISTER_DE25
-	fprintf(stderr, "DE25 Main init: video ready\n");
+	// The shared Agilex shell owns the fixed HDMI/scaler mode. Upstream
+	// video_init() waits on Cyclone V scaler registers that do not exist in
+	// this shell and would prevent headless content launch from completing.
+	fprintf(stderr, "DE25 Main init: fixed fabric video active\n");
+#else
+	video_init();
 #endif
 	if (strlen(cfg.font)) LoadFont(cfg.font);
 	load_volume();
